  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 200 °C.",
    "Lay each carrot between two chopsticks and slice diagonally along it without cutting through. Flip and make straight cuts along the other side.",
    "Roast the carrots with the oil and salt for 15 minutes.",
    "Mix the harissa with the syrup, toss with the carrots and roast another 10–15 minutes until sticky and caramelised.",
    "Blend the yogurt, tahini, coriander, lemon juice and salt until smooth.",
    "Spread the yogurt on a dish, top with the carrots and finish with hazelnuts and coriander."
